 wildest imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/5f55035f3ed49ee3dbb4ba1d0e42d992.poster.avif?t=1768503866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/5f55035f3ed49ee3dbb4ba1d0e42d992.webm?t=1768503866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/5f55035f3ed49ee3dbb4ba1d0e42d992.mp4?t=1768503866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL DETECTIVE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, discover and deduce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/8d1adb57be394fa3ab856006cb59156a.poster.avif?t=1768503866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/8d1adb57be394fa3ab856006cb59156a.webm?t=1768503866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/8d1adb57be394fa3ab856006cb59156a.mp4?t=1768503866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/dd04734ff58c1a55a41e5308803f9be4.poster.avif?t=1768503866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/dd04734ff58c1a55a41e5308803f9be4.webm?t=1768503866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/d